From 58e79ea004eecf5ae82a1945b2fa534727ddefd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SenkOS
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 02:42:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] panfrost, panvk: build only the archs in -Dpanfrost-archs

Every Mali architecture version is a full copy of the per-arch code and its
precompiled shaders: libgallium and libvulkan_panfrost carry ten of them.
A device with one GPU needs one. The default stays all of them.

Per-arch libraries follow the option; the dispatch switches only reference
the versions built (PAN_BUILD_V<n>), and panvk refuses a GPU it wasn't built
for instead of reaching UNREACHABLE.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 meson.build                                 |   4 +
 meson.options                               |   9 ++
 src/gallium/drivers/panfrost/meson.build    |   2 +-
 src/gallium/drivers/panfrost/pan_screen.c   |  20 ++++
 src/panfrost/genxml/decode_common.c         |  50 ++++++++++
 src/panfrost/genxml/meson.build             |   2 +-
 src/panfrost/lib/meson.build                |   2 +-
 src/panfrost/lib/pan_mod.h                  |  20 ++++
 src/panfrost/libpan/meson.build             |   2 +-
 src/panfrost/vulkan/meson.build             |   3 +
 src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_macros.h          | 105 +++++++++++---------
 src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_physical_device.c |  16 +++
 12 files changed, 183 insertions(+), 52 deletions(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index df0241e..7937bfe 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -222,6 +222,10 @@ with_gallium_llvmpipe = gallium_drivers.contains('llvmpipe')
 with_gallium_vc4 = gallium_drivers.contains('vc4')
 with_gallium_v3d = gallium_drivers.contains('v3d')
 with_gallium_panfrost = gallium_drivers.contains('panfrost')
+panfrost_archs = get_option('panfrost-archs')
+foreach a : panfrost_archs
+  pre_args += '-DPAN_BUILD_V@0@'.format(a)
+endforeach
 with_gallium_etnaviv = gallium_drivers.contains('etnaviv')
 with_gallium_tegra = gallium_drivers.contains('tegra')
 with_gallium_crocus = gallium_drivers.contains('crocus')
